  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_5901.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>38 fotos del concierto de Efecto Pasillo, con el que han terminado la noche de este s&aacute;bado las fiestas del Salvador m&aacute;s musicales en Onda. Los canarios han sustituido a la programada M&oacute;nica Naranjo, que suspendi&oacute;&nbsp;su actuaci&oacute;n&nbsp;por una faringitis.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectopasillo/img_5864.jpg\" alt=\"img_5864\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectopasillo/img_5865.jpg\" alt=\"img_5865\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectopasillo/img_5866.jpg\" alt=\"img_5866\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectopasillo/img_5867.jpg\" alt=\"img_5867\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectopasillo/img_5868.jpg\" alt=\"img_5868\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectopasillo/img_5869.jpg\" alt=\"img_5869\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectopasillo/img_5872.jpg\" alt=\"img_5872\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectopasillo/img_5873.jpg\" alt=\"img_5873\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectopasillo/img_5874.jpg\" alt=\"img_5874\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d471543